      "writtenOn": "2023-09-07T21:59:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I worry about the fix breaking things. Particularly now it is possible to fairly easily get the same CFLAGS multiply defined. Writing wasn\u0027t particularly invasive, so I think a backport would be better. It also means that similar issues can be fixed upstream.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 43,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 43,
        "endChar": 8
      },
