      "writtenOn": "2023-09-07T21:44:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e That change is potentially invasive as a\nbackport. As a miminal fix, pass CFLAGS (which contains HOSTCFLAGS via\nKBUILD_HOSTCFLAGS) to the libsubcmd build via EXTRA_CFLAGS, which really\nshould have been done upstream in\ncommit 0e3a1c902ffb (\"tools/resolve_btfids: Build with host flags\")\n\nThen does it make sense to send this to stable linux-6.1.y as\n\nFixes: 0e3a1c902ffb (\"tools/resolve_btfids: Build with host flags\")",
      "revId": "4640f4a0df77adb1a5c46d88966c3aa670a502c7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0e304978_b26ee65c",
