        "id": 1118753
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-07T21:49:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could, although I don\u0027t know who else besides Android would really hit this, since this is firmly related to the hermetic toolchain stuff that _setup_env.sh does. The context of the issue is relevant when applied here but not as much when applied to stable, which makes me feel like the stable maintainers will just tell me to put this in Android anyways but I\u0027ll do whatever you feel is best!",
      "parentUuid": "66cfeacf_3b1df27b",
      "revId": "4640f4a0df77adb1a5c46d88966c3aa670a502c7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
